=== 4. the registration refuses an EXPLAIN text with a hint; the statement inside it is registered ===
SELECT * FROM gg_planman.register_hints('EXPLAIN SELECT count(*) FROM cap_t WHERE v < 1', 'IndexScan(cap_t cap_t_v_idx)');
psql:22_capture_explain.sql:47: ERROR:  utility statements cannot have hints
HINT:  The text is an EXPLAIN: register the statement inside it.
SELECT id, slots FROM gg_planman.register_hints('SELECT count(*) FROM cap_t WHERE v < 1', 'IndexScan(cap_t cap_t_v_idx)');
 id  |       slots        
-----+--------------------
 281 | {public.cap_t=oid}
(1 row)

